1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,120
Across cultures, life's biggest moments are marked in gold and silver.

2
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:07,785
Thirteen gold coins, blessed and passed hand to hand at a wedding.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:11,790
Five silver coins, on a firstborn son's thirty-first day.

4
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:15,615
A piece of gold on Dhun-teh-rus, to welcome Lukshmee home.

5
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:18,750
A gold coin in a red envelope for the Lunar New Year.

6
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:21,945
And a gold sovereign at twenty-one, the key of the door.

